<BaseLayout title="Contact WINKS London · Private line" description="Contact WINKS London to make a reservation, email the team or use the private partner application route.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="page-hero__watermark">HELLO</span><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4 page-hero__content"><div class="breadcrumb-line"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="current">Contact</span></div><span class="eyebrow mt-4">The private line</span><h1>Say hello<br /><em>to WINKS.</em></h1><p>Reservations, questions and private applications — choose the route that feels right.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--line"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="contact-options"><a class="contact-option" href="/contact/reserve"><i class="bi bi-calendar3 contact-option__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><h2>Make a reservation</h2><p>Choose a date, a preferred time and the WINKS experience you would like to explore.</p></div><span class="contact-option__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="contact-option" href="/contact/become-a-masseuse"><i class="bi bi-lock contact-option__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><h2>Become a masseuse</h2><p>A confidential application route. No public profiles, no public gallery, no unnecessary exposure.</p></div><span class="contact-option__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="contact-option" href="/contact/email-winks"><i class="bi bi-envelope contact-option__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><h2>Email WINKS</h2><p>For general questions, location notes, accessibility needs or help choosing a mood.</p></div><span class="contact-option__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--white section--tight"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="content-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">WINKS hours</span><h2 class="section-title">A line open<br /><em>late.</em></h2><p class="lead-copy">Reception is available between 1PM and 2AM, every day. WhatsApp is usually the fastest way to reach us for a private question about timings or location.</p></div><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Direct</span><h3>+44 (0)20 7118 7118</h3><p>WhatsApp: +44 7889 598888</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-gold" href="tel:+442071187118">Call WINKS</a><a class="btn btn-outline-gold" href="https://wa.me/447889598888" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WhatsApp ↗</a></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
